# Anything that ends up on the Pi must keep LF endings.
#
# Git converts LF to CRLF on Windows checkout by default. scp then copies those
# CRLFs to Linux, where a crontab line ending in \r is silently mangled and a
# shell script fails with "bad interpreter". That is exactly what happened on
# 2026-08-23: every installed cron line ended in \r.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.pyc binary
